[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12060.87, "timestamp": "03:21:00", "text": "啊，我知道了。我知道。学习一门语言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12064.15, "timestamp": "03:21:04", "text": "说实话。你会说泰米尔语吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12068.07, "timestamp": "03:21:08", "text": "泰米尔语？呃，我父母会说这个语言。呃，作为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12070.229, "timestamp": "03:21:10", "text": "父母之所以知道，是因为他们观察"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12073.11, "timestamp": "03:21:13", "text": "电影之类的。我能理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12075.269, "timestamp": "03:21:15", "text": "但他却说不出来。我认为如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.19, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "了解泰米尔语，泰米尔语是其中之一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12079.91, "timestamp": "03:21:19", "text": "最难学的语言。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12081.59, "timestamp": "03:21:21", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12083.51, "timestamp": "03:21:23", "text": "我也这么认为。我的意思是，这虽然不是最难的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.269, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "我认为这是最难的之一。塔迪斯是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12088.03, "timestamp": "03:21:28", "text": "我仍然认为普通话。啊，普通话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12091.51, "timestamp": "03:21:31", "text": "是的。我还需要学习这一点，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.55, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "我现在在Billy Billy上直播。所以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12096.71, "timestamp": "03:21:36", "text": "由于语言障碍，这很困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12100.19, "timestamp": "03:21:40", "text": "如果你学习普通话，你就会明白普通话的意义。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12103.11, "timestamp": "03:21:43", "text": "你的路线是学习粤语。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12107.91, "timestamp": "03:21:47", "text": "粤语比较容易。啊，粤语。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12110.15, "timestamp": "03:21:50", "text": "或者你也可以去看看“那是什么”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.99, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "叫什么？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12114.469, "timestamp": "03:21:54", "text": "呃，日本北部，也就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12116.15, "timestamp": "03:21:56", "text": "韩国。学习韩语，哪个是哪个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12119.269, "timestamp": "03:21:59", "text": "现在对你来说应该很容易了，因为"}]